            "review_title": "Review at Nha hang Miya sushi & BBQ",
            "review_text": "Miranda H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nMust try!\nOct 2017 • Couples\nWe stumbled across reviews for this location both on TripAdvisor and Google, and decided to swing by for dinner. Oh my goodness, it was delicious and SO AFFORDABLE! We ordered a sushi boat with four pieces of a sushi roll and about eight pieces of nigiri, plus four other pieces of nigiri and two waters all for less than $10USD. The fish was melt-in-your-mouth good. We were very impressed and will be going back! Tucked away off a quiet street, it is a hidden gem.\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2017",
