            "review_text": "Ballooner66\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing and cheap japanese and korean food!\nJan 2017 • Couples\nWhat a gem! Cute little booths and friendly staff serving every type of japanese or korean you could want! Sushi rolls start from 30 000 and the fancy ones are around 60 000. Japanese Pork cutlet curry was amazing and the kimchi is rocking! Defo worth a stop if you are in the area.\nWritten January 27, 2017",
